      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 107303146,
      "text": "ホウライシダ は、ホウライシダ科ホウライシダ属のシダ植物である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Adiantum capillus-veneris",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adiantum_capillus-veneris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1330973173,
      "text": "Adiantum capillus-veneris, the maidenhair fern, southern maidenhair fern, black maidenhair fern and venus hair fern, is a species of ferns in the genus Adiantum and the family Pteridaceae with a subcosmopolitan worldwide distribution. It is cultivated as a popular garden fern and houseplant."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Adiantum capillus-veneris",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adiantum_capillus-veneris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171582849,
      "text": "Adiantum capillus-veneris, sinónimo: Adiantum pedantum L., es una especie de helecho del género Adiantum."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Capillaire de Montpellier",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capillaire_de_Montpellier",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 236987592,
      "text": "La Capillaire de Montpellier, ou Capillaire cheveux de Vénus, est une espèce de fougères de la famille des Pteridaceae."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Adiantum capillus-veneris",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adiantum_capillus-veneris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 70156053,
      "text": "Adiantum capillus-veneris é uma espécie de pteridófita do género Adiantum, família Pteridaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Adiantum capillus-veneris",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adiantum_capillus-veneris",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29455803,
      "text": "Adiantum capillus-veneris, yang dikenal sebagai suplir atau paku rambut venus, adalah spesies tumbuhan paku dari genus Adiantum dan famili Pteridaceae dengan sebaran subkosmopolitan di seluruh dunia. Tumbuhan ini dibudidayakan sebagai tanaman hias populer, baik sebagai pakis taman maupun tanaman dalam ruangan."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "cultivation": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Adiantum capillus-veneris § Cultivation",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adiantum_capillus-veneris#Cultivation",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1330973173,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "Adiantum capillus-veneris  is cultivated and widely available around the world for planting in natural landscape native plants and traditional shade gardens, for outdoor container gardens, and commonly as an indoor houseplant.\nAdiantum × mairisii is a winter hardy hybrid of Adiantum capillus-veneris with another species, which is likely to be one of Adiantum raddianum, Adiantum aethiopicum, or Adiantum cuneatum.\nAs a houseplant, Adiantum capillus-veneris  requires filtered light and very humid conditions. It should be grown in soil rich in organic matter and should be watered frequently but lightly, to keep the roots damp but not drenched. The temperature should not fall below 12 °C (54 °F). It is propagated by dividing, making sure each clump has a section of rhizome.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Adiantum capillus-veneris § Budidaya",
        "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adiantum_capillus-veneris#Budidaya",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 29455803,
        "heading": "Budidaya",
        "text": "Adiantum capillus-veneris dibudidayakan dan tersedia secara luas di seluruh dunia untuk penanaman di lanskap alami, tanaman asli, dan taman teduh tradisional, untuk taman wadah luar ruangan, dan umumnya sebagai tanaman dalam ruangan.\nAdiantum × mairisii adalah hibrida tahan musim dingin dari Adiantum capillus-veneris dengan spesies lain, yang kemungkinan besar adalah salah satu dari Adiantum raddianum, Adiantum aethiopicum, atau Adiantum cuneatum.\nSebagai tanaman dalam ruangan, Adiantum capillus-veneris membutuhkan cahaya yang disaring dan kondisi yang sangat lembap. Tumbuhan ini harus ditanam di tanah yang kaya akan bahan organik dan harus disiram sesering mungkin namun dalam jumlah sedikit, untuk menjaga akar tetap lembap tetapi tidak basah kuyup. Suhu tidak boleh turun di bawah 12 °C (54 °F). Tumbuhan ini diperbanyak dengan pembagian rumpun, memastikan setiap rumpun memiliki bagian rimpang.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
